# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/prefix-tiers development window (the preconverted GDN checkpoints and the host KV tier; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/prefix-tiers and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are
# resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-prefix-tiers-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/prefix-tiers head (sed -i 's/tp4-prefix-tiers-1/<tag>/' *.env); every later job serves that one
# image. A commit of a file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# T1 (STOP): the prefix gate's tier-attach arm (c2_prefix_gate.py --plan tier-attach, scenario tier_attach) on the audited tier profile (c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-tier-audit): a salted chain of cold/hit pairs (the fast path's bring-up prompts, 2.6k then 6k then 12k tokens), so the
# first hits restore the GDN checkpoint from its PRECONVERTED tensors. The model graft compares them on the card (QWEN_PREFIX_CKPT_PRECONVERTED_AUDIT=1): every tensor stored at capture equals what today's conversion produces from the same host
# values, and after the upload the device scratch read back equals the source. Exactness is the pair verdicts (hit against its cold twin, every output token) and the slot and logits digests. No baseline arm (C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none).
# READ: the plan verdict PASS; '[PREFIX-AUDIT-CKPT] tensors=<n> conversion_equal=1 readback_equal=1' on every restore (a 0 is a FAIL, an absent line NOT_EXERCISED); 'checkpoint preconverted' lines (captures stored preconverted); the tier lines
# ('host tier IO attached', 'host tier on'); every pair IDENTICAL; the program count unchanged across the first hit; the tier counters free of failures (spill/restore failures, digest failures, audit mismatches all zero); restore_ms per hit
# in the [PREFIX] rows (the P1b effect: compare with the same chain on the production profile if the window ran one). Unqualified. Duration (estimate): 60 minutes plus the boot. Stop rule.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-prefix-tiers-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=tier-attach
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-tier-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_BOX_MINUTES=90
